window.products.push({"id":982140,"name":"Airkitty Travel Air Purifier, Necklace Small Portable Air Purifier,100% No Static Electricity,for Car,Airplane,Office,Bedroom and Travel,Air Ionizer(A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Qz3LAgADL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Industry-leading: Compared with other brands of products, AirKitty air purifier necklace have no electric shock, very safe. This portable air purifier releases more than 120 million negative ions to purify personal spaces. It is an ionizer and will not produce air transmission effect like a fan. Working principle: AirKitty mini air purifier produces negative ions to adhere to the impurities in the air, making them become larger and heavier, accelerating them to the ground. It can forming a microscopic health shield, so you can enjoy refresh and clean air at any time! Product function:This personal air purifier can effectively resist the impurities in the air. With USB charging interface,it can be used for 30 hours after charging for 3 hours. No need to replace accessories, and convenient to carry. Portable & Durable: This wearable air purifier is simple and compact. It can be hung around the neck or on the car. It is very fashionable and can be used in car, office, subway, airplane and other places. Let fresh air stay with you forever. Best choice: This air purifier is small and light-weight, and it is very suitable for children, students, elderly and other peoples. You can take better care for your family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Qz3LAgADL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AirKitty","source_asin":"B092VF22G3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VF22G3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VF22G3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
