window.products.push({"id":982148,"name":"Brita 10C WHT Pitcher, Single Unit, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XH3WwCNWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"With a large 10-cup capacity, the Brita Grand is perfect for larger households. View larger An electronic indicator on the Brita Grand reminds you to change the filter. Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher, White Enjoy healthier*, great-tasting water with the Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher. The Brita Grand comes with a filter that reduces undesirable tastes and odors found in tap water. The electronic indicator reminds you when it's time to change the filter. With a large 10-cup capacity, the Brita Grand provides a convenient and cost-effective alternative to buying bottled water. Filter Provides Great-Tasting Water The Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher comes with one activated carbon and ion-exchange resin filter that reduces chlorine taste and odor, zinc taste, copper, mercury, and cadmium* often found in tap water. One Brita Water Filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles, saving you money and cutting down on waste. Electronic Indicator Tells You When to Replace Filter An electronic indicator on the Brita Grand reminds you to change the filter, ensuring your drinking water is at its most refreshing. The indicator has a simple light system: a blinking green light indicates that the filter is good, a blinking yellow light reminds the user that the filter needs to be changed soon, and a red light blinks after 2 months** or 640 pours*** to show that it is time to replace the filter. Easy to Use This water filter pitcher has a soft grip handle for comfort and a flip-top lid that makes it easy to refill. With a sleek, space-efficient shape, the Brita Grand can be stored on your countertop for room temperature water or in your refrigerator for a colder drink. *Certified to reduce Copper & Mercury. Contaminants reduced may not be in all users’ water. **Filter should be replaced after 40 gallons/151 liters (about 2 months for the average family). ***Based on 8 oz. pours; indicator logic does not account for product misuse. Brita Grand Features Ten (8-ounce) cup capacity Ten (8-ounce) cup capacity 1 filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles 1 filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles BPA free pitcher with comfort grip handle BPA free pitcher with comfort grip handle Flip top lid for easy refilling Flip top lid for easy refilling Electronic filter change indicator Electronic filter change indicator What's in the Box: Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher, White, and one Brita Water Filter. What's in the Box: Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher, White, and one Brita Water Filter. Directions Your water filter pitcher can be ready for use in just a few steps. Wash your hands before touching the water filter, then soak it upright for 15 minutes in cold water. Rinse under running tap water and insert the filter into the reservoir, lining up the groove in the filter with the notch in the reservoir. Add cold tap water. The first three pitchers of filtered water may contain carbon dust and can be used on plants or discarded. The filter indicator reminds you to replace the water filter every 40 gallons or 2 months. Brita water filter pitchers come in a variety of capacities, styles, and colors.Brita Slim Water Filter PitcherBrita Atlantis Water Filter PitcherBrita Stainless Water Filter PitcherBrita Everyday Water Filter PitcherBrita Grand Water Filter Pitcher Compact (5 or 6 cups) ✓✓ Large (8 or 10 cups) ✓✓✓ Electronic Filter Change Indicator ✓✓ Easy-Fill Lid ✓✓✓ Comfort Grip Handle ✓✓✓ Assorted Colors or Patterns ✓✓ BPA-Free ✓✓✓✓✓","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XH3WwCNWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brita","source_asin":"B000094Y17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000094Y17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000094Y17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":982149,"name":"AEPDTD Heavy Duty Storage Bag Moving Bags with Reinforced Handles, Extra Large Capacity Clothes Packing Totes Foldable Storage Containers w/Sturdy Zip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K01TV8tcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁EXTRA SPACIOUS SPACE CAPACITY🎁 Size 29\"\" W X 13\"\" H X 15\"\" D, 90L (24 Gallons) volume. Ample space to store and protect almost anything. Good idea for moving, storage, organization. A lightweight, economical, and convenient perfect alternative to traditional cardboard moving boxes or plastic storage bin containers.Great for storage in your closet, garage, basement, attic, or storage unit. 🏆MULTIPURPOSE AND APPLICATIONS🏆 The oversize storage bag is used for storing, transporting, camping, traveling, organizing, space saving, underbed storage and more.Store clothes, shoes, comforters,purses, inflatable beds, backpacks, workout gear, and more. Perfect for moving into your new apartment or college dorm, storing your winter clothes and bedding, and keeping pillow and blankets clean and dust free for guests. A great way to get rid of clutter and organize all your stuff 💪HEAVY-DUTY, RELIABLE & REUSABLE💪 Sturdy construction safely supports 65 lbs.Our moving bags for delivery are made of thick polypropylene woven fabric, water-resistant,tough, firm and reliable, which is durable and built to last. The triple seams on the handles and straps keep carry safely.The strong two-way zippers allow for easy easy loading and unloading. Heavy-duty side handles make the bag easy to transport. 👑BACKPACK STRAPS AND CONVENIENCE👑 The thoughtful backpack strap design can free your hands and facilitate you to do other things. Can be carried like a handbag or backpack! When empty, these bags can be folded down to a small size, folded up for a shelf, or anywhere, and they don't take up much space to store when they're not around us, without the hassle of unboxing and wasting space storing them. Go and organize what you want to put in！ 🎉WHAT YOU GET GREAT SERVICES🎉 We will provide you with 2 pieces moving bags, dark blue color, enough in quantities to meet your daily requirement of using, a nice helper in daily life.After you receive the goods, if any parts are missing or damaged, please contact us to resend freely. We provide our customers with high quality and thoughtful services. If you have any questions about our moving storage bags, please feel free to contact us and we will reply within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K01TV8tcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AEPDTD","source_asin":"B0B76ZBCF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B76ZBCF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B76ZBCF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
