window.products.push({"id":982214,"name":"Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, Cordless Vacuum with 25Kpa Super Suction, 210W Brushless Motor 4-in-1 Powerful Lightweight Vacuum Cleaner, Up to 35 Mins Runt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fiakviM3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏡POWERFUL SUCTION & BRUSHLESS DIGITAL MOTOR——With COMCATION high-efficient 210W brushless motor, Our cordless stick vacuum provides 25KPa powerful suction on MAX mode, easily removes dirt, debris, dust, pet hair, cat litter, pet food, and other messes.This stick vacuum can meet your daily cleaning needs and is perfect for a home with pets, performs perfectly on hardwood floors, low and middle pile carpets, tile, marble, etc. 🏡DETACHABLE BATTERY & LONG-LASTING RUNTIME——With 2200mAh large-capacity rechargeable battery, the cordless stick vacuum cleaner cordless provides a Outstanding cleaning performance for up to 35mins (Standard Mode for 35mins, MAX Mode for 15 mins), which ensures thorough cleaning all around the house. The detachable battery can be charged singly or on its main body. 🏡3 CHARGING METHODS & EASY STORAGE——Comes with a wall mount, this cordless vaccum pet hair can be simply hung on the wall when finishing the cleaning. This battery vacuum cleaner has totally 3 ways to charge, removing the main body to charge, removing the handle to charge, and hanging it on the wall to charge. Easily hidden away in a cupboard, it takes up less room, very convenient to store or use. 🏡4 STAGE HIGH-EFFICIENCY FILTRATION SYSTEM—— The 4-stage fully sealed cyclone filtration system is composed of a HEPA filter with a mesh filter, a stainless steel strainer, and cyclone separation. This stick vacuum cleaner cordless can efficiently capture 99.99% of the microscopic dust particles as small as 0.3 microns to avoid secondary pollution. It can provide ultimate purified air for your families, especially your babies.❤️Note: The detachable filter is washable and there is an additional filter as a gift. 🏡FLEXIBLE LED MOTORIZED BRUSH & ONE BUTTON EMPTY—— Flexible 150° swivel sideways and 90° up and down lets you clean your home in all directions. The maneuverable motorized floor brush head features LED lights, making rechargeable vacuum cordless easy to clean the dust under furniture or in the hard-to-reach corner. One button to quickly empty the 0.55L large dustbin, no need to touch the dirt. 🏡MEET ALL YOUR CLEANING NEEDS&7/24 CUSTOMER SERVICE—— This lightweight handheld vacuum equipped with motorized brush, extension tube, 2 in 1 brush nozzle, which can be assembled with extension tube, flexible nozzle and main motor into 4 combinations. With a long extension tube, this hand vacuum cleaner can be converted to the handheld mode in seconds. The long stick is suitable for a large area cleaning and the handheld mode is for cleaning the surfaces, sofa, bed, corner and cars, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fiakviM3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foppapedretti","source_asin":"B0BV5WBQ82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV5WBQ82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV5WBQ82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
