window.products.push({"id":982265,"name":"NOVICA Hand Blown Clear Blue Recycled Glass Wine Goblets, 10 Oz 'Blue Can-Cun' (Set Of 6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nVgin2bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: The infinite blue of sky and sea grace a crystalline ambience of blown glass. Inspired by the beauty of Cancún's beaches, Javier and Efrén create a set of goblets. Their deep cups capture the bouquet of fine red wine and grace the well-set table. Because each piece is handmade, shape and size can vary slightly and tiny bubbles may appear within the glass. This exemplifies the hand-blown technique, making every piece a unique example of blown glass craftsmanship. - Dishwasher: use top rack only. Hand wash recommended. - Free of lead and toxins - This hand blown item may vary slightly in color, size and shape About our Artist: 'This type of work is a beautiful craft. I love blown glass because of the pure imagination poured into every piece created,\" confides Efren. Working as a team, Javier specializes in the design of the pieces, and Efren transforms the designs into a reality. 'Efren and I make a great team. Over the years we have worked hard to design truly original styles with a distinctly Mexican accent,' says Javier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nVgin2bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00016B38Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00016B38Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00016B38Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
