window.products.push({"id":982310,"name":"Porcelain Kitchen Utensil Holder - Decorative Marble Utensil Crock - 6.5\" Tall Grey Decorative Marble, Art and Office Supplies Holder - by Marbelous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ca7Ejo-rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Can't find the spatula or a kitchen utensil when you need it most? Maybe you want an elegant accessory to spruce up your kitchen, office or living room decor. Whatever you need it for, the Marbelous porcelain crock and holder is as pretty as it is useful. Easily place all of your kitchen utensils in them and have one safe spot that's easy to reach whenever you need them most! They fit easily almost anywhere, and will match almost any look and style! Great for office spaces, art studios, and any place in your home PRODUCT FEATURES High Quality Porcelain Marble Design on Interior and Exterior Dishwasher Safe Great for Holding Kitchen Utensils, Office Supplies, Art Tools, planters and More! COLORS Sky Blue Desert Brown  Grey BRING ELEGANCE TO YOUR KITCHEN What can be more stylish that a complete set of utensil holders made of deluxe quality marble? An aesthetically pleasing look that is sure to bring back a sophisticated look to any kitchen decor! Unlike other crocks, ours is marble inside and out - not just marble painted. They're perfect for any home! USE THEM ANYWHERE, FOR ANYTHING  Maximize the utility of your crocks by using them for all sorts of things. While they are made to perfectly accentuate your kitchen decor and be used as a utensil holder, they're extremely versatile and can be used in various other situations. Great for a pen holder at your office so you can make your work-space looking a lot better. The make for a great holder of art supplies and items such as paintbrushes, markers, erasers, and more! The can be used a great wine cooler by place ice in them and inserting your favorite bottle! Whatever you need, our crocks are here to make your life a lot easier! With Marbelous you're getting unmatched quality with superior performance! Enhance your home and kitchen setup today and get the best set of porcelain canisters around!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ca7Ejo-rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marbelous","source_asin":"B07FVXXZ3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FVXXZ3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FVXXZ3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
