window.products.push({"id":982394,"name":"Unique Oversize Springs Trading Black & White Pearl Beads w/ Free Springs Trading Transparent Water Gel Pearls - Unique Vase Fillers Great for DIY Cen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vUodv3H1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is the perfect DIY centerpiece! The pearl beads have a gorgeous finish and the three sizes are perfect together. Springs Trading water gel is totally clear and shows off our pearl beads beautifully. The pearls appear to be floating in the vase!~You can use the pearls alone or you can customize your centerpiece and make it a one of a kind! Sea shells for a beach wedding or skulls for a halloween party or maybe an underwater light perhaps? Simple or high tech, classic or modern - the look is up to you ~Use the pearl beads on their own without the water gel! They are beautiful in the bottom of a vase with a bouquet of flowers. Simple and classic!~Springs Trading brand water pearls is reuseable! Hydrate and dehydrate over and over again!~We will include easy to follow directions so you can complete your vase with confidence! We aren't your typical seller! We work with these products and make vases so we can answer your questions from actual expierence. We don't just pack 'em and sell 'em. We know tricks like how to keep your vase from getting cloudy!~We have many other colors of these unique vase fillers-white pearl beads, ivory pearl beads, red pearl beads, black pearl beads, blue pearl beads, ivory & white pearl beads, red & white pearl beads, black & white pearl beads and blue & white pearl beads.~These vases are perfect for any occasion-weddings, birthdays, receptions, showers, engagements, retirement parties - any event you have! They are also perfect for gracing your table at home with a beautiful bouquet of flowers. After your event dehydrate them and store for later use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vUodv3H1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Springs Trading","source_asin":"B00JORODZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JORODZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JORODZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
