window.products.push({"id":982622,"name":"DAKEPOLE Rustproof Tension Shower Caddy, Stainless Steel Corner Stand Storage Organizer with Tension Pole for Bathroom Bathtub Shampoo Soap Plants, 4-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711IBelX4uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RUST-FREE STAINLESS STEEL POLE: Constructed of SUS 304 stainless steel material, this tension shower shelf is extremely durable and WON’T get rusted or corroded like other metal shower shelf. Standing the test of longer time and harder water. 4.5-10.8FT CUSTOMIZABLE HEIGHT: This tension shower caddy has several sections to allow for different ceiling heights between 4.5ft to 10.8ft and a sprung-loaded top section that keeps it in position. You can place it from bath tub edge to the ceiling or from the floor to the ceiling with sprung-loaded top without cutting it. The top and bottom have rubber feet to keep it located. 4 HEAVY DUTY BASKETS: 4 Upgraded ABS baskets with great capacity can reach up to 12lb to hold everything from bar & liquid soaps to shampoo to kids bath toys, to razors was laying around. 2 of them have guards so that the shampoos don't slid down. Extra 4 hooks with strong load-bearing capacity for hanging razors/loofahs and washcloths. QUICK DRAINNING & EASY CLAEN: The open grid design for maximum water drainage,water accumulating during shower in the shelves drain easily which means need no frequent cleaning, also keep the shelves from getting gross. The whole tension pole shower caddy stays elegant, tidy and no wobble. WARRANTY AND EASY SETUP: Please message us once there is something wrong when receiving or using this caddy, replacement or refund will be issued at your convenience. Shower pole caddy assembles and installs fast with no drilling.The 4 rubber rings can adjust the height of the tray to hold various sized bottles,such as soaps, shampoo bottles, razors, sponges & more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711IBelX4uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAKEPOLE","source_asin":"B09Q2N9GP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q2N9GP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q2N9GP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":982623,"name":"Elite Gourmet EKT1220DB 1.2L Electric BPA-Free Glass Kettle, Temperature Dial Keep Warm Function, Cordless 360° Base, Blue LED Interior, Auto Shut-Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dBdSP2d1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Elite Gourmet 1.2L Honeypot Water Kettle is the best way to prepare your hot water for all types of hot tea, hot coffee, hot beverages and foods that require adding hot water such as instant hot cocoa, oatmeal or noodles. Simply adjust the temperature dial to desired water temperature or press the boil water switch and you'll have hot water ready in minutes. Once the desired temperature or a boil is reached, the kettle automatically shuts off. No need to worry about hovering over a kettle on the stove or stressing over a forgotten pot boiling over. Your kettle is equipped with boil-dry protection. If it starts heating without enough water in the unit, the heater will automatically shut off to avoid damaging the heating element. It’s easy to pour, share and enjoy your favorite beverages without the worry and restrictions of a short power cord with this stylish and whimsically designed kettle with a 360° rotating detachable power base. The base conveniently sends all the electric power to the kettle and also contains a hidden cord storage compartment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dBdSP2d1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elite Gourmet","source_asin":"B0BYWL96QZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYWL96QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYWL96QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":982624,"name":"Anolon Advanced Clad 5-1/2 Quart Covered Casserole","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NYkWbiDYL._AC_.jpg","description":"This casserole is designed to perform flawlessly on the stovetop or in the oven. It features a large cooking surface to brown or sear meats with ample room to add additional ingredients for a one-dish meal that may be finished on the stovetop or in the oven. The casserole's lid fits snugly to lock in moisture and flavors, making this pan perfect for the long, slow braising of a tender stew. Wider than it is tall, the casserole fits efficiently into your oven. The pan's rugged stainless steel interior is built to hold up to the use of high heat and metal utensils. The bright 18/10 stainless steel cooking surface will not react with foods and the core of aluminum means the entire pan heats evenly, not only on the bottom but up the sides as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NYkWbiDYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B0000UTV32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000UTV32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000UTV32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
