window.products.push({"id":982637,"name":"Cheston Patchwork Block Queen Quilt 4 Pc. Set - Primitive Country Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TacYYQwBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Come home at the end of the day and relax in comfort with our Cheston Patchwork Block Queen Quilt Bundle Set. The set includes a queen quilt, measuring 90x90\", two 21x27\" quilted shams and a queen size ticking stripe bed skirt. The shams have a solid burgundy back with three buttons for easy removal. The back of the quilt is made from the same solid burgundy fabric. The main colors of this collection are burgundy and a slightly tea stained looking creme. The 9\" patchwork blocks are made from various fabrics including a ticking stripe, plaids, checks and vintage prints. One of the vintage style prints is a tiny star pattern and one is a small floral print. There are two different sizes of gingham checks in this quilt. It has a small micro check and a larger one that has 3/8 inch squares. The design and style of these fabric as they blend together create a classic country look for your home. You can use this set in your master bedroom or even is a guest room. All items are washable. However, it is recommended that you always use a commercial front loading washer when laundering the quilt. This is very important since there is hand quilting throughout the quilt. This timeless classic country quilt bundle is made from 100% cotton fabric, has a medium weight batting, and can be used year round.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TacYYQwBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primitive Star Quilt Shop","source_asin":"B06WWLWX3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WWLWX3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WWLWX3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
