window.products.push({"id":982740,"name":"Americana Black Pedestal Desk by Home Styles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vn-7YAObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ideal home office desk provides function with multiple storage options. Crafted of hardwood solids, with a physically distressed oak veneer top and engineered woods. The body has a black painted finish while the oak veneers top is shaped, with burnished ogee edges, which features worm holes, fly specking, and small indentations for an aged oak look. Two lower file drawers on each side accommodate either letter or legal size files, with 4 additional storage drawers, and a center lap drawers that features a fold down front, to accommodate a keyboard tray. Wire management is provided in both the lap drawer and the back modesty panel. Finished on all 4 sides, so it can be floated in the center of a room. Finish and measurements may vary slightly. Assembly required. W-56”, d-25”, h-30 ¾”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vn-7YAObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Styles","source_asin":"B01N0EDC56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0EDC56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0EDC56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":982741,"name":"UA Creations Tealight Candle Holder Hand Painted Ethnic Floral Design Christmas Home décor Accent Gift for Table, Fireplace, Living Room, Office or Et","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I7MpV3hYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Once you take this ethnic art item to your hands, you wouldn't want to give it away! This unique design hand painted tea candle holder comes to you from the heart of Europe - Central Ukraine. It is professionally decorated in an original Ukrainian manner named \"Petrykivka\". Petrykivka decorative painting is a phenomenon of the Ukrainian ornamental folk art, which dates back to the 17th century. This technique is the finest example of unique Slavic art culture, creating an emotional reflection of the communion of humans and nature. Petrykivka painting combines a plentitude of plant ornaments, particularly flowers, with elements of a fantasy fauna (firebirds, phoenix or roosters) and mirrors the unity of physically real nature with the spiritual world, the idea of recurrence of life and endless rebirth. The United Nations recognized this manner of hand painting as a unique form of intangible traditional practices of European culture. Each candle holder requires four coats of lacquer finish, which gives it a deluxe glossy surface. Lightly scented tea candle included. Sold in a white carton box, ready for your gift message. This original tea candle holder will definitely become an elegant gift for your loved ones!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I7MpV3hYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UA Creations","source_asin":"B076X775W3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-982741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076X775W3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076X775W3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
